{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Introduction:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a clever liquid-measuring game ! Given a 5-liter cup and a 3-liter cup, how can you measure exactly 4 liters of water? You start with two empty cups and can perform three actions: fill a cup to the brim, empty it completely, or pour from one cup to the other until either the first cup is empty or the second is full. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Game Instruction:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click to choose a cup</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After select a cup , Right-click to pour water</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is nothing extra, only pure puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Euclid whispered this game idea in my dream (true story).</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668790?t=1771159940","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668790/6b4a7df36858e32b1e77343ae6ccd934ae1de39e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771159940","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668790/85bb814806f927852d72bb92fbb9423203fd3d6e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771159940","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668790/85bb814806f927852d72bb92fbb9423203fd3d6e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771159940","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3704950,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Introduction:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a clever liquid-measuring game ! Given a 5-liter cup and a 3-liter cup, how can you measure exactly 4 liters of water? You start with two empty cups and can perform three actions: fill a cup to the brim, empty it completely, or pour from one cup to the other until either the first cup is empty or the second is full. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Game Instruction:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click to choose a cup</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After select a cup , Right-click to pour water</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is nothing extra, only pure puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Euclid whispered this game idea in my dream (true story).</i></p>","developers":["Li Zheng"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668790/305f0e8607d23d032da54463835df5db6895424e/header.jpg?t=1771159940","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3668790/715439258/149d467e69d2ae1115dbaf3b71ec86c19ef5a655/1770213881/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770214481","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3668790/715439258/149d467e69d2ae1115dbaf3b71ec86c19ef5a655/1770213881/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770214481","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3668790/715439258/149d467e69d2ae1115dbaf3b71ec86c19ef5a655/1770213881/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770214481","id":257126517,"name":"WaterMeasure","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126517/479acc1e200fe2b8fee8de1b473947c5aeabace2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770214481"}],"name":"WaterMeasure","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit pr